.TH "ANIMATIONTIMELINE.CURRENTTIME" "3JS" "September 1, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
AnimationTimeline.currentTime \- AnimationTimeline: currentTime property
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]currentTime\f[B]\f[R] read\-only property of the Web
Animations API\(cqs \f[CR]AnimationTimeline\f[R] interface returns the
timeline\(cqs current time in milliseconds, or \f[CR]null\f[R] if the
timeline is inactive.
.SH VALUE
A number representing the timeline\(cqs current time in milliseconds, or
\f[CR]null\f[R] if the timeline is inactive.
.SH REDUCED TIME PRECISION
To offer protection against timing attacks and fingerprinting, the
precision of \f[CR]animationTimeline.currentTime\f[R] may be reduced
depending on browser settings.
.PP
The current time normally advances with animation frames.
Reading the property repeatedly while a script runs does not provide a
continuously updating clock.
.PP
For a \f[CR]DocumentTimeline\f[R], the current time is calculated by
subtracting the \f[CR]originTime\f[R] offset, which can be supplied by
script, from the browser\(cqs animation clock.
.PP
In Chrome, the rounding interval for the animation clock during
rendering updates is 0.1 ms, or 0.005 ms in cross\-origin\-isolated
contexts.
The browser does not apply additional timer rounding after subtracting
\f[CR]originTime\f[R].
.PP
In Safari, the rounding interval for the animation clock is 1 ms, or
0.02 ms in cross\-origin\-isolated contexts.
After subtracting \f[CR]originTime\f[R], the browser rounds the returned
value to 0.001 ms, the resolution used to represent animation times.
.PP
In Firefox, after subtracting \f[CR]originTime\f[R], the browser rounds
the returned value to 0.02 ms by default, including in
cross\-origin\-isolated contexts.
If \f[CR]privacy.resistFingerprinting\f[R] is enabled, the rounding
interval is 16.667 ms or the interval configured by
\f[CR]privacy.resistFingerprinting.reduceTimerPrecision.microseconds\f[R],
whichever is larger.
.PP
For example, these are possible values in Firefox:
.IP
.EX
\f[I]// Reduced time precision (0.02 ms) with default settings\f[R]
animationTimeline.currentTime;
\f[I]// Might be:\f[R]
\f[I]// 23.4\f[R]
\f[I]// 24.18\f[R]
\f[I]// 25.5\f[R]
\f[I]// \&...\f[R]

\f[I]// Reduced time precision with \(gaprivacy.resistFingerprinting\(ga enabled\f[R]
animationTimeline.currentTime;
\f[I]// Might be:\f[R]
\f[I]// 50.001\f[R]
\f[I]// 66.668\f[R]
\f[I]// 83.335\f[R]
\f[I]// \&...\f[R]
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
